<?jelly escape-by-default='true'?>
<j:jelly xmlns:j="jelly:core">
  <div class="jenkins-alert jenkins-alert-danger">
    <p>No artifact manager is configured. In a cluster, artifacts and stashes must be kept in shared storage: without
      it, they stay on the controller that made them, so a build adopted by another controller loses its stashes, and a
      fresh controller lacks the artifacts of earlier builds. Configure one under
      <a href="${rootURL}/manage/configure">System</a> (Artifact Management for Builds), for example azure-artifact-manager
      with the cluster's blob container.</p>
  </div>
</j:jelly>
